        "# Free-threaded build\n",
        "\n",
        "A free-threaded build of CPython supports running with the global interpreter lock disabled. Extensions that do not support free threading may cause the lock to be enabled.\n",
        "\n",
        "Source: [Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-free-threaded-build)"
      ]
    }
